---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Delete your online data — Invisible Ink" description="How to delete your Invisible Ink online play data on Android and the web.">

  <section class="legal-page">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <div class="reveal">
        <h1>Delete your online data</h1>
        <p class="legal-date">Last updated: November 20, 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-content reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">

        <p>This page is for <strong>Invisible Ink: Drawing Games</strong> on Google Play and Invisible Ink on the web. Invisible Ink has no sign-up: online play uses an anonymous account, created the first time you choose an online name. Drawings and progress you make offline stay on your device and are removed when you uninstall the app (on the web, when you clear the site's data in your browser).</p>

        <h2>In the app</h2>
        <ol>
        <li>Open Invisible Ink.</li>
        <li>Go to <strong>Settings &rsaquo; Online</strong>.</li>
        <li>Tap <strong>Delete My Online Data</strong> and confirm.</li>
        </ol>
        <p>If you're offline, the deletion finishes the next time the app connects.</p>

        <h2>What the app deletes</h2>
        <p>Your online profile (online name and avatar), your entries on the all-time and current week's leaderboards, your achievements, your friends list, friend code and block list. You also leave any games in progress.</p>

        <h2>What we delete when you ask</h2>
        <p>Some online data can't be removed by the app on its own yet: your anonymous account ID, your entries on earlier weeks' leaderboards, your place in other players' friends lists, and your tournament entries, drawings, votes, results and rewards. To have these deleted, or if you no longer have the app, e-mail <a href="mailto:privacy@blinddraw.ink?subject=Delete%20my%20online%20data">privacy@blinddraw.ink</a> with the subject "Delete my online data" and your online name. We'll ask for a detail only you would know (such as your friend code or a recent game), so that nobody else can delete your data, and confirm within 30 days.</p>

        <h2>What is kept, and for how long</h2>
        <ul>
        <li>Games you already finished stay with the game, so the other players of that game can still see them.</li>
        <li>Reports you filed about other players or tournament entries are kept for moderation for up to 12 months.</li>
        <li>Data that Google holds for analytics, ads or crash reporting is kept under Google's own retention settings.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>If you stop using online play without deleting your data, we delete your online profile and the data listed above after 24 months without online use.</p>
        <p>More about what online play stores is in the <a href="/privacy/#online-play">Privacy Policy</a>. Questions can be sent to <a href="mailto:privacy@blinddraw.ink">privacy@blinddraw.ink</a>.</p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 10rem 0 4rem;
  }

  .legal-page h1 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal-date {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .legal-content h2:first-child {
    border-top: none;
    padding-top: 0;
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .legal-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .legal-content p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .legal-content ul {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .legal-content li {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .legal-content a {
    color: var(--accent-purple);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .legal-content a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-pink);
  }
</style>
